{"unit_id":"dougen__dsh-cdp#feature-1","repo":"dougen/dsh-cdp","commit":"2a6c9fa4caf87deaf84677b7b2aed63cd7b588c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cdp 的功能「浏览器页面检查」：列出标签页并读取页面 DOM 或无障碍树快照，返回页面标题、地址和结构信息。通过 browser-cdp 技能调用 snapshot 命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1171-1183","lib/index.js:1296-1332"]}
